From 3ef2be21ab7aedb2803785fbf20a060a25170233 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 22:23:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] chimera: sync the current Vino protocol core

Refresh the userspace oracle from the authoritative kernel sources and adapt the shim to the typed HDCP message identifiers, current control framing, per-head EDID requests, and two-stream authentication sequence. Keep the vendored sources byte-identical across rustfmt runs and make live EDID discovery preserve both control counters and transport failures.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-0
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
Signed-off-by: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
